 dans la commande du 2 avril 2024 ?", "sql": "SELECT T1.common_name FROM plant_variety AS T1 JOIN sales_order_line AS T2 ON T1.variety_id = T2.variety_id JOIN sales_order AS T3 ON T2.order_id = T3.order_id WHERE T3.order_date = '2024-04-02'"}, {"id": "v2:new:synthetic_073:1:7", "question": "Trouvez les noms des clients ayant passé une commande en ligne.", "sql": "SELECT DISTINCT T3.customer_name FROM sales_order_line AS T1 JOIN sales_order AS T2 ON T1.order_id = T2.order_id JOIN customer AS T3 ON T2.customer_id = T3.customer_id WHERE T2.channel = 'web'"}, {"id": "v2:new:synthetic_073:1:8", "question": "Quel est le nombre total de plants provenant de fournisseurs certifiés biologiques et stockés dans un tunnel ?", "sql": "SELECT SUM(T1.quantity) FROM stock_lot AS T1 JOIN supplier AS T2 ON T1.supplier_id = T2.supplier_id JOIN nursery_section AS T3 ON T1.section_id = T3.section_id WHERE T2.organic_certified = 1 AND T3.location_type = 'tunnel'"}, {"id": "v2:new:synthetic_073:1:9", "question": "Quel est le nom de la section contenant le lot dont la quantité en stock est la plus faible ?", "sql": "SELECT T1.section_name FROM nursery_section AS T1 JOIN stock_lot AS T2 ON T1.section_id = T2.section_id WHERE T2.quantity = ( SELECT MIN ( quantity ) FROM stock_lot )"}, {"id": "v2:new:synthetic_073:1:10", "question": "Quelles variétés Marie Lambert a-t-elle achetées ?", "sql": "SELECT DISTINCT T4.common_name FROM customer AS T1 JOIN sales_order AS T2 ON T1.customer_id = T2.customer_id JOIN sales_order_line AS T3 ON T2.order_id = T3.order_id JOIN plant_variety AS T4 ON T3.variety_id = T4.variety_id WHERE T1.customer_name = 'Marie Lambert'"}, {"id": "v2:new:synthetic_073:1:11", "question": "Quel est le nom botanique de la variété la plus chère ?", "sql": "SELECT botanical_name FROM plant_variety WHERE unit_price = ( SELECT MAX ( unit_price ) FROM plant_variety )"}, {"id": "v2:new:synthetic_073:1:12", "question": "Quelle variété apparaît le plus souvent dans les lignes de commande ?", "sql": "SELECT T1.common_name FROM plant_variety AS T1 JOIN sales_order_line AS T2 ON T1.variety_id = T2.variety_id GROUP BY T2.variety_id ORDER BY COUNT(*) DESC LIMIT 1"}, {"id": "v2:new:synthetic_073:1:13", "question": "Quelles sont les 3 expositions au soleil les plus fréquentes parmi les variétés proposées ?", "sql": "SELECT sun_exposure FROM plant_variety GROUP BY sun_exposure ORDER BY COUNT (*) DESC LIMIT 3"}, {"id": "v2:new:synthetic_073:1:14", "question": "Quels lots sont disponibles ou proviennent de Jardins Bio du Sud ?", "sql": "SELECT T1.lot_id FROM stock_lot AS T1 JOIN supplier AS T2 ON T1.supplier_id = T2.supplier_id WHERE T1.status = 'available' OR T2.company_name = 'Jardins Bio du Sud'"}, {"id": "v2:new:synthetic_073:1:15", "question": "Quelle variété possède le plus grand nombre de lignes de commande ?", "sql": "SELECT T1.common_name FROM plant_variety AS T1 JOIN sales_order_line AS T2 ON T1.variety_id = T2.variety_id GROUP BY T1.common_name ORDER BY COUNT ( DISTINCT T2.line_id ) DESC LIMIT 1"}, {"id": "v2:new:synthetic_073:2:0", "question": "Quel type de plante est le moins représenté dans le catalogue ? Indiquez le type et le nombre de variétés.", "sql": "SELECT plant_type, count(*) FROM plant_variety GROUP BY plant_type ORDER BY count(plant_type) ASC LIMIT 1"}, {"id": "v2:new:synthetic_073:2:1", "question": "Donnez le nom du fournisseur qui approvisionne le plus grand nombre de lots.", "sql": "SELECT T1.company_name FROM supplier AS T1 JOIN stock_lot AS T2 ON T1.supplier_id = T2.supplier_id GROUP BY T2.supplier_id ORDER BY count(*) DESC LIMIT 1"}, {"id": "v2:new:synthetic_073:2:2", "question": "Quel client nommé Marie Lambert a commandé plus de 10 plants au total ?", "sql": "SELECT T1.customer_name FROM customer AS T1 JOIN sales_order AS T2 ON T1.customer_id = T2.customer_id JOIN sales_order_line AS T3 ON T2.order_id = T3.order_id JOIN plant_variety AS T4 ON T3.variety_id = T4.variety_id WHERE T1.customer_name = 'Marie Lambert' GROUP BY T1.customer_name HAVING SUM ( T3.quantity ) > 10"}, {"id": "v2:new:synthetic_073:2:3", "question": "Affichez les noms des fournisseurs dont les lots sont stockés dans des sections ayant une capacité supérieure à 70 unités.", "sql": "SELECT T1.company_name FROM supplier AS T1 JOIN stock_lot AS T2 ON T1.supplier_id = T2.supplier_id JOIN nursery_section AS T3 ON T2.section_id = T3.section_id WHERE T3.capacity_units > 70"}, {"id": "v2:new:synthetic_073:2:4", "question": "Quelles sections contiennent à la fois des lots disponibles et des lots de plus de 100 unités ?", "sql": "SELECT T1.section_name FROM nursery_section AS T1 JOIN stock_lot AS T2 ON T1.section_id = T2.section_id JOIN plant_variety AS T3 ON T2.variety_id = T3.variety_id WHERE T2.status = 'available' INTERSECT SELECT T1.section_name FROM nursery_section AS T1 JOIN stock_lot AS T2 ON T1.section_id = T2.section_id JOIN plant_variety AS T3 ON T2.variety_id = T3.variety_id WHERE T2.quantity > 100"}, {"id": "v2:new:synthetic_073:2:5", "question": "Quels sont les noms des fournisseurs biologiques situés en Occitanie ou dans les Pays de la Loire ?", "sql": "SELECT company_name FROM supplier WHERE organic_certified = 1 AND region = 'Occitanie' UNION SELECT company_name FROM supplier WHERE organic_certified = 1 AND region = 'Pays de la Loire'"}, {"id": "v2:new:synthetic_073:2:9", "question": "Quel identifiant de client et quelle date de commande correspondent au client ayant passé le plus de commandes en avril 2024 ?", "sql": "SELECT customer_id, order_date FROM sales_order WHERE order_date LIKE '2024-04-%' GROUP BY customer_id ORDER BY COUNT(*) DESC LIMIT 1"}, {"id": "v2:new:synthetic_073:2:10", "question": "Quels sont les fournisseurs des lots stockés dans la section qui possède la plus grande capacité ?", "sql": "SELECT supplier_id FROM stock_lot WHERE section_id = ( SELECT section_id FROM nursery_section WHERE capacity_units = ( SELECT MAX ( capacity_units ) FROM nursery_section ) )"}, {"id": "v2:new:synthetic_073:2:11", "question": "Quels sont les noms de variétés ayant le nom le plus élevé ou contenant la lettre « a » ?", "sql": "SELECT max(common_name) FROM plant_variety UNION SELECT common_name FROM plant_variety WHERE common_name LIKE '%a%'"}, {"id": "v2:new:synthetic_073:2:12", "question": "Quel client a commandé le plus grand nombre de variétés distinctes provenant de lots disponibles ?", "sql": "SELECT T1.customer_name FROM customer AS T1 JOIN sales_order AS T2 ON T1.customer_id = T2.customer_id JOIN sales_order_line AS T3 ON T2.order_id = T3.order_id JOIN plant_variety AS T4 ON T3.variety_id = T4.variety_id JOIN stock_lot AS T5 ON T3.lot_id = T5.lot_id WHERE T5.status = 'available' GROUP BY T1.customer_name ORDER BY COUNT ( DISTINCT T4.common_name ) DESC LIMIT 1"}, {"id": "v2:new:synthetic_073:2:13", "question": "Quels sont les identifiants des lots dont le fournisseur est situé à Nimes ou dans la région Occitanie ?", "sql": "SELECT T1.lot_id FROM stock_lot AS T1 JOIN supplier AS T2 ON T1.supplier_id = T2.supplier_id WHERE T2.city = 'Nimes' OR T2.region = 'Occitanie'"}, {"id": "v2:new:synthetic_073:2:15", "question": "Quels sont le nom du client et le statut de sa commande pour Marie Lambert ?", "sql": "SELECT T1.customer_name, T2.order_status FROM customer AS T1 JOIN sales_order AS T2 ON T1.customer_id = T2.customer_id WHERE T1.customer_name = 'Marie Lambert'"}, {"id": "v2:new:synthetic_073:3:1", "question": "Quel client a passé le plus de commandes ?", "sql": "SELECT T1.customer_name FROM customer AS T1 JOIN sales_order AS T2 ON T1.customer_id = T2.customer_id GROUP BY T1.customer_id ORDER BY count(*) DESC LIMIT 1"}, {"id": "v2:new:synthetic_073:3:2", "question": "Quelles commandes de Marie Lambert contiennent des lots fournis par Jardins Bio du Sud ?", "sql": "SELECT DISTINCT T1.customer_id, T3.order_id FROM customer AS T1 JOIN sales_order AS T2 ON T1.customer_id = T2.customer_id JOIN sales_order_line AS T3 ON T2.order_id = T3.order_id JOIN stock_lot AS T4 ON T3.lot_id = T4.lot_id JOIN supplier AS T5 ON T4.supplier_id = T5.supplier_id WHERE T1.customer_name = 'Marie Lambert' AND T5.company_name = 'Jardins Bio du Sud'"}, {"id": "v2:new:synthetic_073:3:4", "question": "Trouvez la quantité et le coût unitaire des lots dont le coût est inférieur au coût unitaire moyen des lots disponibles.", "sql": "SELECT quantity, unit_cost FROM stock_lot WHERE unit_cost < (SELECT avg(unit_cost) FROM stock_lot WHERE status = 'available')"}, {"id": "v2:new:synthetic_073:3:6", "question": "Trouvez les noms distincts des variétés dont le prix est supérieur au prix minimum des variétés aromatiques.", "sql": "SELECT DISTINCT common_name FROM plant_variety WHERE unit_price > (SELECT min(unit_price) FROM plant_variety WHERE plant_type = 'aromatique')"}, {"id": "v2:new:synthetic_073:3:7", "question": "Dans quelles sections le fournisseur Jardins Bio du Sud possède-t-il des lots ?", "sql": "SELECT DISTINCT T3.section_id FROM stock_lot AS T1 JOIN supplier AS T2 ON T1.supplier_id = T2.supplier_id JOIN nursery_section AS T3 ON T1.section_id = T3.section_id WHERE T2.company_name = 'Jardins Bio du Sud' GROUP BY T3.section_id"}, {"id": "v2:new:synthetic_073:3:8", "question": "Quelles variétés Marie Lambert a-t-elle commandées ?", "sql": "SELECT DISTINCT T4.variety_id FROM customer AS T1 JOIN sales_order AS T2 ON T1.customer_id = T2.customer_id JOIN sales_order_line AS T3 ON T2.order_id = T3.order_id JOIN plant_variety AS T4 ON T3.variety_id = T4.variety_id WHERE T1.customer_name = 'Marie Lambert'"}, {"id": "v2:new:synthetic_073:3:9", "question": "Quels sont le nom et la ville du fournisseur qui possède le plus grand nombre de lots dans des sections de plus de 500 unités de capacité ?", "sql": "SELECT T1.company_name, T1.city FROM supplier AS T1 JOIN stock_lot AS T2 ON T1.supplier_id = T2.supplier_id JOIN nursery_section AS T3 ON T2.section_id = T3.section_id WHERE T3.capacity_units > 500 GROUP BY T1.supplier_id ORDER BY count(*) DESC LIMIT 1"}, {"id": "v2:new:synthetic_073:3:10", "question": "Quels sont les noms des variétés qui sont soit des vivaces, soit adaptées à la mi-ombre ?", "sql": "SELECT common_name FROM plant_variety WHERE plant_type = 'vivace' UNION SELECT common_name FROM plant_variety WHERE sun_exposure = 'mi_ombre'"}, {"id": "v2:new:synthetic_073:3:11", "question": "Quel taux de remise a été appliqué à la commande de Marie Lambert passée le 2024-04-02 ?", "sql": "SELECT T1.discount_rate FROM sales_order_line AS T1 JOIN sales_order AS T2 ON T1.order_id = T2.order_id JOIN customer AS T3 ON T2.customer_id = T3.customer_id WHERE T3.customer_name = 'Marie Lambert' AND T2.order_date = '2024-04-02'"}, {"id": "v2:new:synthetic_073:3:12", "question": "Quelles commandes de Marie Lambert contiennent de la Lavande vraie et au moins une autre variété ?", "sql": "SELECT T6.order_id FROM sales_order AS T6 JOIN customer AS T4 ON T6.customer_id = T4.customer_id JOIN sales_order_line AS T3 ON T3.order_id = T6.order_id JOIN sales_order_line AS T5 ON T5.order_id = T6.order_id JOIN plant_variety AS T2 ON T2.variety_id = T3.variety_id JOIN plant_variety AS T1 ON T1.variety_id = T5.variety_id WHERE T4.customer_name = 'Marie Lambert' AND T2.common_name = 'Lavande vraie' AND T1.variety_id != 1"}, {"id": "v2:new:synthetic_073:3:13", "question": "Quelle section contient le plus grand nombre de lots ?", "sql": "SELECT T1.section_name FROM nursery_section AS T1 JOIN stock_lot AS T2 ON T1.section_id = T2.section_id GROUP BY T2.section_id ORDER BY count(*) DESC LIMIT 1"}, {"id": "v2:new:synthetic_073:3:14", "question": "Combien de villes distinctes accueillent des fournisseurs dont la certification biologique est inférieure à la moyenne ?", "sql": "SELECT count(DISTINCT city) FROM supplier WHERE organic_certified < (SELECT avg(organic_certified) FROM supplier)"}, {"id": "v2:new:synthetic_073:3:15", "question": "Combien de clients n'ont passé aucune commande ?", "sql": "SELECT count(*) FROM customer WHERE customer_id NOT IN (SELECT customer_id FROM sales_order)"}]}

Évalue chaque paire question/SQL pour ce schéma SQLite.

Question à te poser : un expert SQL qui lit seulement la question française et le schéma écrirait-il une requête dont le résultat est identique à celui du SQL fourni ?

- pass : oui. La question peut être formulée naturellement, sans nommer les colonnes techniques ni décrire la syntaxe ; les choix conventionnels d'un expert (par exemple afficher le nom pour « quel client ») sont acceptables.
- fail : la question ajoute, retire ou modifie une contrainte ; le SQL renvoie des colonnes que la question ne demande pas, ou oublie une colonne demandée ; l'agrégat, le tri, la limite, la négation, la jointure ou une valeur ne correspond pas ; la question est absurde, tautologique ou mal écrite en français.
- uncertain : la question admet plusieurs lectures raisonnables qui donnent des résultats différents.

Conventions du jeu Spider, à accepter sans les pénaliser : jointure interne même pour « chaque » ou « tous » ; regroupement ou INTERSECT/EXCEPT sur un nom affiché plutôt que sur un identifiant ; doublons possibles sans DISTINCT quand la question ne demande pas explicitement des valeurs distinctes ; cas limites théoriques (homonymes, valeurs NULL, ex æquo) que la question n'évoque pas. Ne rejette que les écarts de sens réels.

