ers ou ayant le niveau de fidélité gold.", "sql": "SELECT customer_id, customer_name FROM customer WHERE loyalty_level = 'gold' OR customer_type = 'particulier'"}, {"id": "v2:new:synthetic_073:4:12", "question": "Quelles variétés sont à la fois disponibles en stock et présentes dans des commandes de plus de dix unités ?", "sql": "SELECT T1.common_name FROM plant_variety AS T1 JOIN stock_lot AS T2 ON T1.variety_id = T2.variety_id WHERE T2.status = 'available' INTERSECT SELECT T3.common_name FROM plant_variety AS T3 JOIN sales_order_line AS T4 ON T3.variety_id = T4.variety_id WHERE T4.quantity > 10"}, {"id": "v2:new:synthetic_073:4:13", "question": "Montrez les variétés qui ne sont pas des plantes aromatiques.", "sql": "SELECT common_name FROM plant_variety EXCEPT SELECT common_name FROM plant_variety WHERE plant_type = 'aromatique'"}, {"id": "v2:new:synthetic_073:4:14", "question": "Combien de lignes de commande Marie Lambert a-t-elle enregistrées à chaque date de commande ?", "sql": "SELECT DISTINCT COUNT ( t3.line_id ), t2.order_date FROM customer AS t1 JOIN sales_order AS t2 ON t1.customer_id = t2.customer_id JOIN sales_order_line AS t3 ON t2.order_id = t3.order_id WHERE t1.customer_name = 'Marie Lambert' GROUP BY t2.order_date"}, {"id": "v2:new:synthetic_073:4:15", "question": "Trouvez le nom et la ville des clients qui ont passé une commande sur le site web, mais jamais par téléphone.", "sql": "SELECT T1.customer_name, T1.city FROM customer AS T1 JOIN sales_order AS T2 ON T1.customer_id = T2.customer_id WHERE T2.channel = 'web' EXCEPT SELECT T1.customer_name, T1.city FROM customer AS T1 JOIN sales_order AS T2 ON T1.customer_id = T2.customer_id WHERE T2.channel = 'phone'"}, {"id": "v2:new:synthetic_073:5:0", "question": "Quel type de client est le plus représenté ?", "sql": "SELECT customer_type FROM customer GROUP BY customer_type ORDER BY count(*) DESC LIMIT 1"}, {"id": "v2:new:synthetic_073:5:1", "question": "Quel nom de client apparaît le plus souvent dans le